abstract: >
  This clarification states that Verrell’s Law is not related to Rupert Sheldrake’s
  morphic resonance. Verrell’s Law is a physics-based framework centred on electromagnetic
  field memory, observer-as-measurer collapse bias, and memory-weighted emergence in
  physical and informational systems. It does not rely on mystical, spiritual, or
  metaphysical claims.

